[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3263445963","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110183#issuecomment-3263445963","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110183","id":3263445963,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ChDvL","user":{"login":"Lielay9","id":40064911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMDY0OTEx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40064911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9","html_url":"https://github.com/Lielay9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-07T04:05:22Z","updated_at":"2025-09-07T04:05:22Z","body":"https://xkcd.com/1172/\r\nI haven't necessarily disabled `restore_scenes_on_load` for performance reasons, I just prefer to start without previous scenes loaded - the disabled behavior defaulting to opening the main scene has been a happy accident. On toy-projects with single or couple scenes, the relevant scene opens automatically, and on bigger projects I can mentally reset after every session and start a day from scratch. On some older projects it's also helpful at locating the main scene to start the process of retracing the project scene hierarchy. Finally the setting has eased editing tool scripts in-editor after _some_ idiot from a minute ago bricked the scene by writing an infinite loop.\r\n\r\nCould we keep the toggle or better yet make a new property with 3 options: previous, main, none?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3263445963/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3263732998","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110183#issuecomment-3263732998","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110183","id":3263732998,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7CiJ0G","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-07T12:14:28Z","updated_at":"2025-09-07T12:14:28Z","body":"I restored the setting, but changing how it works is out of scope for this PR.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3263732998/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"perfo